script:
The talent points to the floating kinetic question above their head: { Looking for science backed skincare? }
Hands enter from frame sides (5 to 6 hands) each holding different competing products.
The host confidently picks the Cellcense bottle: [ Try Cellcense ].

On-screen text: { Try not to steal the best collagen peptides in town }
Two hosts stand in the office eyeing the product tub placed front and center on the table, pondering from different angles with playful suspenseful music.
In the end, they both make a hilarious synchronized dash to grab the tub.
